@baseUrl = http://localhost:5001
### ONVIF CCTV Backend API Requests

### 1. Root / Server Info
GET {{baseUrl}}/
Accept: application/json

### 2. Health Check & Stream Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### 3. Discover ONVIF Devices on Network
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/discover
Accept: application/json

### 4. Connect to ONVIF Device
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/connect
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "xaddr": "http://192.168.29.102:8000/onvif/device_service",
  "user": "admin",
  "pass": "password123"
}

### 5. Start RTSP Stream (using ONVIF credentials)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/stream/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "xaddr": "http://192.168.1.100:80/onvif/device_service",
  "user": "admin",
  "pass": "password123"
}

### 6. Start RTSP Stream (using direct RTSP URL)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/stream/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rtspUrl": "rtsp://admin:password123@192.168.1.100:554/stream1"
}

### 7. Stop Stream & Recording
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/stream/stop
Content-Type: application/json

### 8. List Recordings
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/recordings
Accept: application/json

### 9. Download Recording File
# Replace filename value with actual recording filename returned by /api/recordings
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/recordings/download?id=recording_example.mp4

### 10. Stream Recording for Video Player
# Replace filename value with actual recording filename
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/recordings/stream?id=recording_example.mp4

### 11. List Detection Alerts
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/alerts
Accept: application/json

### 12. Download Alert Image
# Replace filename value with actual alert filename returned by /api/alerts
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/alerts/download?id=alert_example.jpg

### 13. PTZ Control Movement
# Actions: up, down, left, right, zoomIn, zoomOut, stop
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ptz/move
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "xaddr": "http://192.168.1.100:80/onvif/device_service",
  "user": "admin",
  "pass": "password123",
  "action": "up",
  "speed": 0.5
}

### 14. Proxy Snapshot Image
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/snapshot?snapshotUrl=http%3A%2F%2F192.168.1.100%2Fonvif%2Fsnapshot.jpg&user=admin&pass=password123
